{"heroId":10,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/chrono_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/paradox_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/chrono_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"Manipulates Space and Time","playstyle":"Manipulating time lets Paradox outpace an enemy in one on one combat. She thrives by subjecting her enemies to timely swaps into a waiting pulse grenade, her wall, or into the middle of her teammates.","lore":"Paradox.  An artifact of time, and the name of a notorious thieves' guild... one that prides themselves on constructing elaborate heists that target the most untouchable of individuals and institutions.  What does Paradox do with the countless artifacts, state secrets, and celebrity paternity tests that they have stolen?  Put it on display at pop-up museums, so that they can show the world that no one is out of Paradox’s reach.\n\nShrouded in mystery, each member of Paradox dons a mask and takes on the organization's name.  They are everywhere.  They are nowhere.  And if they want something, they are inevitable.","tags":["Calculated","Disruptor","Tactician"]},"es":{"role":"Manipula el espacio y el tiempo","playstyle":"La manipulación del tiempo le permite a Paradoja superar a sus enemigos en combates uno contra uno. Su técnica infalible consiste en colocar muros o granadas de pulsaciones a punto de explotar cerca de sus enemigos, o intercambiar posiciones con ellos de manera oportuna.","lore":"Paradoja. Un artefacto del tiempo y el nombre de un conocido gremio de ladrones... que se enorgullece de realizar intrincados atracos contra las personas e instituciones más intocables. ¿Qué hace Paradoja con los innumerables artefactos, secretos de estado y pruebas de paternidad de famosos que roba? Exhibirlos temporalmente para mostrar al mundo que nadie está fuera del alcance de Paradoja.\n\nQuienes pertenecen a esta misteriosa organización, además de llevar una máscara, adoptan el nombre de Paradoja. Están en todas partes y en ninguna al mismo tiempo. Y, si quieren algo, son inevitables.","tags":["Calculadora","Disruptiva","Táctica"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":58655583,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Pulse Grenade","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/chrono/chrono_time_bomb.webp","video":{"mp4":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/videos/hero_abilities/chrono_time_bomb_h264.mp4","webm":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/videos/hero_abilities/chrono_time_bomb.webm"},"quip":[{"t":"Throw a grenade that pulses, dealing damage and time slowing"}],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Throw a grenade that begins pulsing when it lands. Each pulse expands the radius and applies "},{"t":"spirit damage","attr":"SpiritDamage","icon":"attr_SpiritDamage"},{"t":", "},{"t":"time slow, and stacking","hi":true},{"t":" "},{"t":" "},{"t":"increased damage"},{"t":" for Paradox against the victim."}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Pulse Damage","value":"35","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/damage_magic_color.svg","spirit":0.3},{"label":"Damage Amp per stack","value":"4","unit":"%","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/damage_crit.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Radius Per Pulse","value":"1m","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/range.svg"},{"label":"Pulse Interval","value":"0.8","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/duration.svg"},{"label":"Amp Duration","value":"8.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/duration.svg"},{"label":"Time Slow","value":"20","unit":"%","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/condition_slow.svg"},{"label":"Slow Duration","value":"0.2","unit":"s","ico